OL,3,GNEWSAOne-punch killer jailed after
OL,4,Avictim's 'kind gesture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed after killing a
OL,7,Ffather-of-two who had attempted to buy
OL,8,Fhim a drink to try to calm him down
OL,9,Ffollowing a fight with another person,
OL,10,Fpolice said.
OL,12,FRabindra Bullyram was an "innocent
OL,13,Fbystander" when Kieran Lettin knocked
OL,14,Fhim out with one punch in an unprovoked
OL,15,Fattack after being offered the drink
OL,16,Ffollowing a fight outside the Waterend
OL,17,FBarn pub in St Albans in October 2025,
OL,18,FHertfordshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
