OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOne-punch killer jailed after
OL,4,Avictim's 'kind gesture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBullyram died in hospital several
OL,7,Fmonths later, with one of his sons
OL,8,Fsaying: "As a result of that kind
OL,9,Fgesture, he ended up losing his life in
OL,10,Fsuch a violent way."
OL,12,FLettin, 45, of Benbow Close in the
OL,13,Fcity, was jailed for four years and 10
OL,14,Fmonths after pleading guilty to
OL,15,Fmanslaughter.
